  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "القوة \n المحطة"
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "التقنية \n الإجراء"
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "معدات:\n تبريد الهواء\n مولد لSفريق \n توربين\n 11.5 ك.ف.، 175 م.ف.أ \n ALSTOM"
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "رقم الوثيقة: G-011-r0"
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "صدرت إلى:\n Damietta \n CCPS"
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "حالة: \n موافقة"
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "إجراء:Minor \n Maintenance Procedures (P1-Y5)"
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "موافقة Date: 09 Feb 2005"
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "تاريخ المراد مراجعتها: Feb 2010"
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "مقدمة"
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "This document outlines the \nminor maintenance procedures P1, which must be performed every 5 years as \nindicated by Y5 in the title block."
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "The first draft initiated by eng. \n Mohamed Salah El Din Badawy, tested by eng Abd El Wahab Abd El Wahab Ahmed, \n accepted \nby eng. Ahmed El Hosiny general \n director, \n revised by EDEPC inspection & quality control eng. Adel Abdel Qader EL Nagar, \n and approved by eng. Mohamed El Sarag Damietta PS head sector"
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "This document is \naccepted \nby eng. Samir Abd El Gilil EDEPC MPIS \n coordinator, and certified by accountant; \nMahmoud \n Mohamed Soliman;\n EDEPC admin and financial inspection, quality control General Director and supervisor of inspection and quality control قطاع الرأس."
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "احتياطات السلامة"
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "A work permit must be issued and \n the maintenance staff should carry the suitable safety category."
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "Maintenance staff should be well \n trained, qualified or directly supervised by some one who is."
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "Safety fence with caution marks surrounding the work \n area is required."
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "Personal protective equipment must \n be used (safety shoes, helmet, breathing mask, safety glasses)."
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "The operator, who is inside the \n stator, is deprived from any metallic or magnetic object (kees, phones, tape \n measure, chain )."
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "Protect the inferior part of \n endwinding and core, with a rubber carpet or plastic film, which will move with \n a make progress expertise."
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "Supply of necessity, by \n intermediate of separate cubicle, the eventual appliance, and lighting put on \n work inside the core stator."
  },
  {
