 "text": "القوة \n المحطة\nالتقنية \n الإجراء\nمعدات:\n تبريد الهواء\n مولد لSفريق \n توربين\n 11.5 ك.ف.، 175 م.ف.أ \n ALSTOM\nرقم الوثيقة: G-011-r0\nصدرت إلى:\n Damietta \n CCPS\nحالة: \n موافقة\nإجراء:Minor \n Maintenance Procedures (P1-Y5)\nموافقة Date: 09 Feb 2005\nتاريخ المراد مراجعتها: Feb 2010\nمقدمة\nThis document outlines the \nminor maintenance procedures P1, which must be performed every 5 years as \nindicated by Y5 in the title block.\nThe first draft initiated by eng. \n Mohamed Salah El Din Badawy, tested by eng Abd El Wahab Abd El Wahab Ahmed, \n accepted \nby eng. Ahmed El Hosiny general \n director, \n revised by EDEPC inspection & quality control eng. Adel Abdel Qader EL Nagar, \n and approved by eng. Mohamed El Sarag Damietta PS head sector\nThis document is \naccepted \nby eng. Samir Abd El Gilil EDEPC MPIS \n coordinator, and certified by accountant; \nMahmoud \n Mohamed Soliman;\n EDEPC admin and financial inspection, quality control General Director and supervisor of inspection and quality control قطاع الرأس.\nاحتياطات السلامة\nA work permit must be issued and \n the maintenance staff should carry the suitable safety category.\nMaintenance staff should be well \n trained, qualified or directly supervised by some one who is.\nSafety fence with caution marks surrounding the work \n area is required.\nPersonal protective equipment must \n be used (safety shoes, helmet, breathing mask, safety glasses).\nThe operator, who is inside the \n stator, is deprived from any metallic or magnetic object (kees, phones, tape \n measure, chain ).\nProtect the inferior part of \n endwinding and core, with a rubber carpet or plastic film, which will move with \n a make progress expertise.\nSupply of necessity, by \n intermediate of separate cubicle, the eventual appliance, and lighting put on \n work inside the core stator.\nA work permit must be issued and \n the maintenance staff should carry the suitable safety category.\nMaintenance staff should be well \n t